From bc52d49b988d05d5dcb87e459577f602b49234ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Umair Ahmed Shah <umairahmedshah@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 14:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: broadcom: bcm2712-rpi-5-b: add ramoops reserved
 memory

Reserve 1 MiB at 0x13000000 for the kernel's pstore_ram backend so the
last kernel messages, console and pmsg survive a warm reset under
/sys/fs/pstore/ on the next boot. The region sits above U-Boot's FIT
staging area (0x08000000 plus the decompressed kernel) and below the
firmware's own reservations.

Pairs with pstore-persist.cfg (CONFIG_PSTORE_RAM) and the
edge-pstore-persist userspace archival to /data on the next boot.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific configuration]
Assisted-by: claude-code:claude-fable-5-1
Signed-off-by: Umair Ahmed Shah <umairahmedshah@hotmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts
index 4ccacb6f05cc..22073eb2036d 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts
@@ -104,3 +104,19 @@ cpu_crit: cpu-crit {
 		};
 	};
 };
+
+/ {
+	reserved-memory {
+		#address-cells = <2>;
+		#size-cells = <2>;
+		ranges;
+
+		ramoops@13000000 {
+			compatible = "ramoops";
+			reg = <0x0 0x13000000 0x0 0x00100000>;
+			record-size = <0x00020000>;
+			console-size = <0x00020000>;
+			pmsg-size = <0x00020000>;
+		};
+	};
+};
-- 
